  "filesDescription": "Select the database's .cbh file: the .cbg, .cbp, .cbt files (and .cba for comments/annotations) sharing the same name are loaded automatically if they are in the same folder. You can also select several files manually, or directly a .cbv archive (created via \"Save database\" in ChessBase).",
